WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.519 --> 00:00:11.789
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WELL, THAT CREEPY

00:00:09.687 --> 00:00:13.490
PORN LAWYER WORKING FOR STORMY

00:00:11.922 --> 00:00:14.625
DANIELS HAD ANOTHER BUSY

00:00:13.624 --> 00:00:17.395
WEEKEND ON CABLE TELEVISION

00:00:14.759 --> 00:00:18.429
WHERE HE VOWED TO INVADE MORE

00:00:17.528 --> 00:00:22.033
PEOPLE'S PRIVATE LIVES.

00:00:18.562 --> 00:00:22.834
FOR ME, IT'S TIME HE, HIMSELF,

00:00:22.166 --> 00:00:24.135
WAS GIVEN A CLOSER LOOK.

00:00:22.967 --> 00:00:25.770
HERE IS WHAT THE FEDERALIST

00:00:24.268 --> 00:00:26.137
MOLLY HEMINGWAY SUGGESTED THE

00:00:25.903 --> 00:00:27.872
OTHER DAY.

00:00:26.337 --> 00:00:29.106
&gt;&gt; HE IS THE FRONT MAN FOR A

00:00:28.005 --> 00:00:30.074
WELL-FUND AND A

00:00:29.574 --> 00:00:31.576
WELL-COORDINATED OPERATION

00:00:30.208 --> 00:00:32.777
THAT RECEIVED NEXT TO NO

00:00:31.709 --> 00:00:34.045
CRITICISM OR REFLECTION BY

00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:35.713
MANY PEOPLE IN THE MEDIA.

00:00:34.178 --> 00:00:36.714
I THINK IT IS WORTH ASKING WHO

00:00:35.847 --> 00:00:39.250
IS THIS GUY?

00:00:36.848 --> 00:00:42.453
HOW DOES HE HAVE ACCESS TO

00:00:39.383 --> 00:00:45.056
SPECIAL COUNSEL DOCUMENTS?

00:00:42.587 --> 00:00:46.257
WHO IS PAYING FOR THIS?

00:00:45.189 --> 00:00:48.025
IT'S WORTH FINDING OUT THIS

00:00:46.390 --> 00:00:51.195
THING THAT IS DRIVING SO MUCH

00:00:48.159 --> 00:00:52.830
OF THE COVERAGE.

00:00:51.395 --> 00:00:53.231
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WHO IS THE CREEPY

00:00:52.964 --> 00:00:55.299
PORN LAWYER?

00:00:53.364 --> 00:00:56.100
WE DON'T ASK THE QUESTIONS

00:00:55.433 --> 00:00:57.802
ENOUGH.

00:00:56.234 --> 00:00:58.903
BUT MARK STEYN JOINS US.

00:00:57.935 --> 00:01:00.638
WHO IS THIS GUY?

00:00:59.103 --> 00:01:06.677
&gt;&gt; HE IS A WACKY GUY.

00:01:00.771 --> 00:01:07.044
HE USED TO RUN TULL'S COFFEE

00:01:06.811 --> 00:01:08.512
COMPANY.

00:01:07.178 --> 00:01:09.513
FOR MOST OF US NORTH OF THE

00:01:08.646 --> 00:01:09.847
BORDER SOUNDS LIKE A BACK

00:01:09.647 --> 00:01:15.019
JOKE.

00:01:09.981 --> 00:01:16.454
HE HAD A COMPANY, IF YOU'RE A

00:01:15.153 --> 00:01:17.855
SUCCESSFUL LAWYER YOU'D HAVE

00:01:16.587 --> 00:01:20.358
GLOBAL BARRISTERS BUT HE HAD

00:01:17.989 --> 00:01:23.128
ONE THAT WAS GLOBAL BARISTAS

00:01:20.492 --> 00:01:24.462
AND GOT SUED NOT PAYING FOR

00:01:23.261 --> 00:01:26.865
$160,000 WORTH OF COFFEE,

00:01:24.596 --> 00:01:27.532
WHICH IS LITERALLY GROUNDS FOR

00:01:26.998 --> 00:01:30.201
A LAWSUIT.

00:01:27.665 --> 00:01:30.602
I MEAN, I DON'T QUITE

00:01:30.335 --> 00:01:32.971
UNDERSTAND.

00:01:30.735 --> 00:01:34.472
THIS GUY, THIS GUY NOT ONLY

00:01:33.104 --> 00:01:36.174
DOESN'T HE APPEAR TO HAVE EVER

00:01:34.606 --> 00:01:39.377
MADE ANY MONEY FOR HIS

00:01:36.307 --> 00:01:39.744
CLIENTS, HIS OWN LAW FIRM WENT

00:01:39.511 --> 00:01:42.414
BANKRUPT.

00:01:39.878 --> 00:01:45.283
I HAVE NEVER HEARD OF --

00:01:42.547 --> 00:01:46.318
BECAUSE AMERICA EMPLOYS AS

00:01:45.417 --> 00:01:48.019
MANY LAWYERS AS THE REST OF

00:01:46.451 --> 00:01:50.322
THE PLANET COMBINED.

00:01:48.153 --> 00:01:53.258
I HAVE NEVER HEARD OF A LAWYER

00:01:50.455 --> 00:01:53.692
SO INCOMPETENT HIS OWN FIRM

00:01:53.391 --> 00:01:57.095
GOES BANKRUPT.

00:01:53.825 --> 00:01:57.596
THIS GUY IS A VERY ECCENTRIC

00:01:57.395 --> 00:01:59.164
FIGURE.

00:01:57.729 --> 00:02:01.499
AS MOLLY SAID THERE IS A LOT

00:01:59.297 --> 00:02:01.933
MORE TO BE FOUND OUT ABOUT

00:02:01.633 --> 00:02:03.468
HIM.

00:02:02.133 --> 00:02:04.769
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WHAT DOES IT SAY

00:02:03.602 --> 00:02:06.071
ABOUT CABLE TELEVISION OR THE

00:02:04.903 --> 00:02:08.473
OTHER TWO NETWORKS THAT THIS

00:02:06.204 --> 00:02:10.709
GUY HAS BEEN THE SINGLE MOST

00:02:08.607 --> 00:02:11.943
FREQUENT GUEST MAYBE EVER?

00:02:10.909 --> 00:02:13.178
&gt;&gt; WELL, I THINK WHAT IT SAYS

00:02:12.077 --> 00:02:14.846
IS ACTUALLY THAT HE IS MUCH

00:02:13.311 --> 00:02:15.614
BETTER AT BEING A CABLE GUEST

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:18.016
THAN A LAWYER.

00:02:15.747 --> 00:02:19.251
I MEAN THE TRAGEDY HERE --

00:02:18.217 --> 00:02:24.022
&gt;&gt; Tucker: GOOD POINT.

00:02:19.451 --> 00:02:26.825
&gt;&gt;  -- IS THAT STORMY -- I BET

00:02:24.156 --> 00:02:27.926
YOU, POOR OLD STORMY WON'T SEE

00:02:26.959 --> 00:02:31.964
$70 -- SHE WON'T HAVE ENOUGH

00:02:28.060 --> 00:02:34.633
MONEY TO BUY A DECAF AVENATTI

00:02:32.097 --> 00:02:37.402
AT THE TULLY'S COFFEE STORE BY

00:02:34.766 --> 00:02:39.271
THE TIME IT'S ALL THROUGH.

00:02:37.536 --> 00:02:39.638
BUT HE WILL GET PUBLICITY OUT

00:02:39.404 --> 00:02:40.239
OF IT.

00:02:39.771 --> 00:02:42.508
THAT IS IT.

00:02:40.439 --> 00:02:43.175
&gt;&gt; Tucker: THAT IS A REALLY

00:02:42.641 --> 00:02:44.676
GOOD POINT.

